steinbridge.bench.preparing=Stein benchmark: preparing the world. Keyboard and mouse are off; close the window to stop it
steinbridge.bench.done=Stein benchmark finished. The report is at %s
steinbridge.bench.failed=Stein benchmark: the report could not be written (%s)
steinbridge.bench.invalid=Some parts ran with the window out of focus, minimized or resized: they are marked in the report
